-<p>
-<em>Live a full battery life.</em> MacBook&nbsp;Air has up to 18&nbsp;hours of battery life. And it supports fast charging, getting up to 50&nbsp;percent in about 30&nbsp;minutes.<sup class="footnote footnote-number">
-<a href="#footnote-19" aria-label="Footnote 16" data-modal-close="">16</a>
-</sup> So you can power through everything from work to class to your favorite movies without worrying about your battery.</p>
