-<h3 class="typography-body">AI apps on Mac. Born to run.</h3>
-<p>Mac is optimized to handle AI apps — like ChatGPT, LM Studio, Msty Studio, Topaz Video, and Topaz Photo — so you can learn faster, think in new ways, and get more done.</p>
