-<p class="typography-modal-headline modal-headline gradient-text-blue">M5. The chip that&nbsp;zips.</p>
-<div class="article-copy large-9 medium-11 small-12 typography-section-intro-elevated">
-<p>The M5&nbsp;chip in MacBook&nbsp;Air features a next-generation GPU with up to 10 cores, each with a powerful new Neural Accelerator. The M5&nbsp;chip also includes a 10‑core CPU with faster multithreaded performance. It fuels all your demanding apps, including Microsoft 365 Copilot and Adobe Creative Cloud, making them run faster so you can be productive all day on a single charge.</p>
